# Input
```css
/* should generate diagnostics */
a { top: 0px; }
a { top: 0px + $offset; }
a { font: 0px/0px cursive; }
a { @include border-left-radius($input-top-left-radius: 0px); }
@mixin foo($x: 0px) { width: $x; }
@function foo($x: 0px) { @return $x; }
a { --x: 0px; }

```

